# level_docks.vmus: level 3 (the river docks), docs/design/audio.md Music.
# Original composition for this project. Mood: swung, river rhythm.
# Same five notes as the title (D E G A C), centred on A so it sits lower and
# rolls; the title motif (D A G A C A) returns on the lead in sections A.
# Channels: 0 lead, 1 offbeat "oar" stabs, 2 walking bass, 3 drums.
# Tempo 2: 8 rows per beat = 131 BPM. Swing: the off-beat eighth falls on row 5
# of the beat (5:3, close to a triplet shuffle). A pattern is 2 bars = 3.66 s.
vmus 1
tempo 2

inst 01 square   vol=34 a=1 d=8 s=36 r=8 duty=96    # lead, 37% duty
inst 02 triangle vol=64 a=0 d=0 s=64 r=3            # walking bass
inst 03 triangle vol=64 a=0 d=5 s=0                 # kick: pitch drops with D7f
inst 04 noise    vol=34 a=0 d=2 s=0                 # closed hat
inst 05 noise    vol=52 a=0 d=6 s=0                 # snare
inst 06 noise    vol=24 a=6 d=30 s=0                # water wash (slow swell)
inst 07 square   vol=30 a=0 d=5 s=16 r=4 duty=40    # oar stab (arpeggiated chord)
inst 08 pluck    vol=60 a=0 d=0 s=64 r=10 damp=252  # plucked lead
inst 09 noise    vol=36 a=0 d=4 s=0 mode=1          # rope clank

